{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"y":0.044653505446701991,"w":0.082990023295084647,"h":0.020363371632443839,"t":"Reading","x":0.83740631989465009,"c":1},{"h":0.017198699906160742,"t":"Questions 33-37","y":0.094849847924998065,"c":1,"x":0.086014858016812731,"w":0.17705537160237628},{"t":"Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?","y":0.13067846592728016,"c":1,"h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.084188899324941155,"w":0.80903493245442715},{"c":1,"w":0.41273101806640622,"x":0.084188905653009988,"h":0.017509603922346018,"y":0.16715116281210141,"t":"In boxes 33-37 on your answer sheet, write"},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.15605749461586674,"w":0.045174538294474292,"c":1,"y":0.20348837235954531,"t":"YES"},{"c":1,"y":0.22093023280877333,"t":"NO","h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.034907598495483416,"x":0.1560574942840858},{"x":0.29144205574625459,"w":0.48285471598307295,"h":0.019929441378883195,"c":1,"t":"if the statement agrees with the claims of the writer","y":0.20060623687124901},{"w":0.47843943277994788,"c":1,"y":0.21946902655818734,"h":0.015996089586466034,"t":"if the statement contradicts the claims of the writer","x":0.29158110510001584},{"h":0.019999645311923886,"c":1,"t":"NOT GIVEN if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this","y":0.23671027812021195,"w":0.6592660522460938,"x":0.15599866935768603},{"x":0.084188912396158083,"c":1,"y":0.27315634208628636,"w":0.82135523478190098,"h":0.017541332301136969,"t":"33 Many people who ended up winning prestigious intellectual prizes only reached an"},{"y":0.29378690081883851,"w":0.29591868082682293,"h":0.017674397156301813,"c":1,"t":"average standard when young.","x":0.12924264126901752},{"y":0.32122093021708353,"h":0.015988371857499684,"t":"34","x":0.084188912666332286,"w":0.030800819396972656,"c":1},{"x":0.1149185779133263,"w":0.67159530639648435,"h":0.020285819624729196,"y":0.32093205553350279,"t":"Einstein's failures as a young man were due to his lack of confidence.","c":1},{"w":0.032854207356770818,"t":"35","x":0.084188912707651553,"y":0.35319767448261019,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1},{"h":0.016224188790560534,"x":0.1149897325930012,"y":0.35309734518292135,"c":1,"t":"It is difficult to reach agreement on whether some children are actually born gifted.","w":0.78850102742513029},{"w":0.026694043477376306,"t":"36","x":0.084188912458779325,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.38372093047899913},{"t":"Einstein was upset by the public's view of his life's work.","y":0.38226744188272366,"w":0.53798767089843746,"c":1,"h":0.017441860412777732,"x":0.12320328969235457},{"y":0.41133720954876662,"t":"37","c":1,"h":0.013081394746943475,"w":0.026694043477376306,"x":0.084188912458779325},{"x":0.11704310932679467,"t":"Einstein put his success down to the speed at which he dealt with","y":0.40988372104460702,"w":0.63039016723632812,"h":0.016074981239341368,"c":1},{"w":0.18891170501708987,"t":"scientific questions.","c":1,"x":0.13141683733373738,"h":0.016058688318483227,"y":0.42877906986819481},{"t":"Questions 38-40","x":0.086242298949059562,"y":0.47522123887716461,"w":0.17659137725830082,"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"x":0.086129121065942088,"h":0.020628807045365405,"y":0.51130749766909533,"w":0.36572591145833333,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","c":1},{"x":0.08616636062255334,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 38-40 on your answer sheet.","y":0.548080630812259,"h":0.018010733050231043,"w":0.57512715657552083,"c":1},{"t":"38 What does Eyre believe is needed for children to equal 'gifted' standards?","x":0.084188914700290052,"w":0.73921971638997386,"c":1,"h":0.017510461947910949,"y":0.58720930213372735},{"t":"strict discipline from the teaching staff","x":0.17659137435338249,"h":0.016043252860550306,"y":0.61622418887560038,"w":0.35728953043619793,"c":1},{"x":0.13141683822240893,"c":1,"w":0.016427103678385402,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"B","y":0.63517441877478398},{"h":0.020392395964765941,"w":0.41715199788411461,"y":0.63232814527012482,"c":1,"t":"assistance from their peers in the classroom","x":0.17644364997874565},{"h":0.016224188790560534,"y":0.65250737463993636,"w":0.5564681498209636,"c":1,"t":"the development of a spirit of inquiry towards their studies","x":0.16427105849678109},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"y":0.67005813959888916,"w":0.01848049322764081,"t":"D","x":0.13141683747242192},{"w":0.58332244873046868,"h":0.019263946623225503,"t":"the determination to surpass everyone else's achievements","x":0.15393172007175177,"y":0.66804404109333926,"c":1},{"x":0.084188912983814201,"y":0.69911504410920988,"c":1,"t":"39 What is the result of Ericsson's research?","w":0.439425048828125,"h":0.0145477463713789},{"x":0.17243799949892785,"w":0.65512044270833325,"c":1,"t":"Very gifted students do not need to work on improving memory skills.","y":0.72586507689641089,"h":0.018483506824414686},{"h":0.017465871062602223,"w":0.67145792643229174,"c":1,"t":"Being born with a special gift is not the key factor in becoming expert.","y":0.74418604651924203,"x":0.16016426109465859},{"y":0.76453488392843849,"w":0.01848049322764081,"t":"C","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"x":0.13141683747242192},{"w":0.01848049322764081,"x":0.13141683747242192,"t":"D","y":0.7819767443935548,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"y":0.76308139546303022,"x":0.16632444326120785,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"t":"Including time for physical exercise is crucial in raising performance.","w":0.65297739664713539},{"y":0.77815803623012669,"w":0.62851404825846358,"x":0.1764990563184915,"t":"10,000 hours of relevant and demanding work will create a genius.","h":0.021420531146294275,"c":1},{"x":0.084115201130135139,"y":0.8062780390204588,"h":0.020971464759129033,"t":"40 In the penultimate paragraph, it is stated the key to some deprived children's success is","c":1,"w":0.83178848266601546},{"t":"a regular and nourishing diet at home.","h":0.017957704819760889,"w":0.36158592224121089,"y":0.83546926916797848,"c":1,"x":0.17648280070081057},{"c":1,"y":0.85465116296083044,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"B","x":0.13347022622694871,"w":0.014373715718587227},{"c":1,"x":0.13141683742181351,"y":0.87354651137475015,"t":"C","h":0.011627907316944963,"w":0.016427105267842634},{"c":1,"t":"D","h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.014373715718587227,"y":0.89098837230053152,"x":0.13347022622694871},{"w":0.41273101806640622,"y":0.85457227125142066,"c":1,"t":"the loving support of more than one parent.","x":0.17453798162548528,"h":0.016067263510374907},{"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"x":0.17453800426443972,"y":0.87050147472131501,"t":"a community which has well-funded facilities for learning.","w":0.5400410461425782},{"t":"the guidance of someone who recognises the benefits of learning.","y":0.88953488383562929,"x":0.17248460675118338,"w":0.62833674112955729,"h":0.016069835899150453,"c":1},{"w":0.12936345418294259,"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1,"x":0.73716632209065369,"y":0.92296511638328205,"t":"→ • p. 123"},{"w":0.024640657107035335,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"51","x":0.89527720727810445,"y":0.92296511651460966},{"w":0.45882354736328124,"y":0.94166666659226195,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176469619230891}]}